1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
川菜的魂，其实不是辣椒
The soul of Sichuan food isn't chili.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
是这一缸红褐色的酱
It's this vat of red-brown paste.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
郫县豆瓣，三百年手艺
Pixian doubanjiang — three centuries old.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
辣椒配蚕豆，慢慢发酵
Chili and broad beans, slowly fermented.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
讲究"日晒夜露"
The rule: sun by day, dew by night.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
白天翻晒，夜里露天吸潮
Turned in the sun, left open at night.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
少则半年，久则数年
From six months to several years.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
一勺入锅，红油就出来了
One spoon in the wok — red oil blooms.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
回锅肉、麻婆豆腐都靠它
Twice-cooked pork, mapo tofu — all of it.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
没有它，川菜就不算川菜
Without it, Sichuan food isn't itself.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,400
你家炒菜，放不放豆瓣？
Do you cook with doubanjiang at home?

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,900
下集：一次煮糊的意外
Next: an accident left on the stove.
